data: {"id": "24b0d6b6f8c64276-thinking-parallel_evidence-1262", "run_id": "24b0d6b6f8c64276", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "让我根据已采集的工具结果进行根因证据分析。\n\n## 实体身份确认\n\n**Pod:** `aiops-case-v06/workload`\n- Node: node2/10.2.0.50\n- Status: ContainerCreating (70m)\n- Phase: Pending\n- Labels: `aiops.lab/case-id=v06`, `app.kubernetes.io/name=workload`\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 生命周期状态（支持 ContainerCreating 异常持续）\n- **kubectl get**: `workload 0/1 ContainerCreating 0 70m node2 <none>` — 70分钟内未变化\n- **kubectl get yaml**: phase=Pending, containerStatuses 中 Container ID 为空，Image ID 为空\n- **状态条件**: Initialized=True, Ready=False, ContainersReady=Fal", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 8, "ts_ms": 1789130969959, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "24b0d6b6f8c64276-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "24b0d6b6f8c64276", "seq": 1263, "ts_ms": 1789130978976, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 79.902, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v06", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/24b0d6b6f8c64276-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2b3dca8e4373122c252736dc1fb37f6455bf6bb6e31ae7996035346fd0d9d3b2", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "6b45131c611f1adc3ad4c6c04f23fa671d70aa3c1e1274223d9ff2deca7cead6"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

